Homepage: https://github.com/Ununus/prologd2
Description: Prolog-D logic programming system
 Prolog-D is a logic programming system with two engines: Prolog-U
 (this repository's C++23 interpreter) and the original Prolog-D. The
 package carries the Qt window, the console interpreters, the manuals in
 PDF, the lesson examples and the standard library.
